<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sulfŭrātus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sulph-</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>impregnated with sulphur</i>, <i>sulphurated.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fontes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 8,
					3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aqua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					31, 6, 32, § 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ramentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					10, 3, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">merx,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 57, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					5</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gehenna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 1, 28</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sul-fŭrāta</span></b> ,
			ōrum, n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> (Sc. fila.) <i>Brimstone-matches</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 1,
				42, 4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> (Sc. loca.) <i>Veins of sulphur</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 31, 3,
				28, § 49</span></i>.</div>
